---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = "+17044696658";
const phoneDisplay = "+1 (704) 469-6658";
---
<Layout title="Weak Airflow From AC Vents Gastonia NC | acrepairgastonianc.com" description="Low airflow from AC vents in Gastonia? Clogged filter, blower motor, or duct issues. Address before compressor damage. Call +1 (704) 469-6658.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / <a href="/problems/">Problems</a> / Weak Airflow</p>
      <h1>Weak Airflow From AC Vents</h1>
      <p>Low airflow usually signals a clogged filter, failing blower motor, or duct problems. Left alone, it overloads your compressor.</p>
      <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-white btn-lg">Call {phoneDisplay}</a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-block">
      <p><span class="badge badge-warn">Address Soon</span></p>
      <p>Start with the filter — a dirty filter is the most common and easiest fix. If airflow is still weak after replacement, the blower motor, capacitor, or ductwork may be at fault. Restricted airflow also contributes to frozen coils.</p>
      <p>We diagnose the full air path and repair or replace components as needed. Related: <a href="/services/central-ac-repair/">Central AC Repair</a>, <a href="/problems/frozen-coils/">Frozen Coils</a>.</p>
      <div class="cta-box">
        <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Call {phoneDisplay}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
